  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0959:b001:l001": "Flour, sword and broken twig in1–5 are retained as oath gestures; no additional ritual steps supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0959:b001:l008": "Бери read as пери, fairy, in the fairy-born epithet; edition preface15 explicitly records this spelling.",
    "manas-2010:p0959:b001:l014": "Not leaving a hair is the completeness idiom.",
    "manas-2010:p0959:b001:l019": "Female leopard in19–25 refers contextually to Kanykey; animal imagery retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0960:b001:l009": "Pronoun shifts in9–12 address Kanykey and Manas in succession; not harmonized.",
    "manas-2010:p0960:b001:l011": "The puppy’s vulture origin belongs to the epic account; not replaced with ordinary canine birth.",
    "manas-2010:p0960:b001:l020": "Desire and escape in20–25 are the compressed promise concerning the puppy; conditional agency remains uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0960:b001:l035": "Promise not to whip is retained despite the subsequent abuse.",
    "manas-2010:p0960:b001:l036": "Күнү provisionally the co-wife relationship, from the күнүлөш family of terms; exact shortened form uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0960:b001:l041": "Breast covered with earth/grass is retained as the printed animal image.",
    "manas-2010:p0961:b001:l013": "Айым rendered as the address My Lady.",
    "manas-2010:p0961:b001:l014": "Night here and sun in15 retained without silently harmonizing time of day.",
    "manas-2010:p0961:b001:l019": "Agricultural devastation in19–21 retained as the stated cost of the puppy.",
    "manas-2010:p0961:b001:l023": "Шаа is strength/means, not intrinsic worth: Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/шаа/. Sentence continues through24.",
    "manas-2010:p0961:b001:l025": "Sixty young wives retained beside eighty at963:2.",
    "manas-2010:p0961:b001:l033": "Secret action in33–35 retained despite the surrounding public gathering.",
    "manas-2010:p0962:b001:l015": "Казы rendered rib fat; this line does not establish a processed sausage.",
    "manas-2010:p0962:b001:l016": "Tongue provisionally the puppy’s; mouth in17 Kanykey’s, following the feeding context.",
    "manas-2010:p0962:b001:l023": "Forty ropes is the printed hyperbole.",
    "manas-2010:p0962:b001:l025": "Moonless spring retained as the printed image.",
    "manas-2010:p0962:b001:l033": "Causative command provisionally concerns the attendants making the animal endure treatment.",
    "manas-2010:p0963:b001:l009": "Saxaul is the shrub named by сөксөөл.",
    "manas-2010:p0963:b001:l012": "Three finger-widths preserves the traditional measure without metric conversion.",
    "manas-2010:p0963:b001:l021": "Implicit subject changes to Manas in the accusation at22–25.",
    "manas-2010:p0963:b001:l036": "Күйпүлкүчүк is a scrawny/shaggy puppy, not singed: Yudakhin күйпүл, with puppy example, https://kotormo.kg/sites/default/files/2025-02/sozduk_yudahin.pdf.",
    "manas-2010:p0963:b001:l040": "Карып rendered reduced to misery, not an unsupported assertion of physical crippling.",
    "manas-2010:p0963:b001:l042": "Тейтелек provisionally a diminutive of тейтей in the noblewoman address; exact diminutive tone uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b001:l003": "Күйпүлкүчүк repeats the scrawny-puppy accusation; see963:36.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b001:l006": "Marriage and religious scholars in6–8 retained without adding details of consummation.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b001:l020": "Self-blame and blame in20–24 belong to the narrated conflict; no endorsement added.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b001:l023": "Brow/eyebrow image retained in the complaint; exact idiomatic force uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0965:b001:l009": "Күрмөк is barnyard millet/weed associated with rice fields, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/күрмөк/.",
    "manas-2010:p0965:b001:l013": "Үрбү is read as the personal name Ürbü despite lowercase extraction.",
    "manas-2010:p0965:b001:l025": "Üyrülmö and Chogulma retained as named gathering places without modern identification.",
    "manas-2010:p0966:b001:l001": "Кээсин чыгар is to take revenge/teach a lesson, primary Yudakhin and2015 dictionary https://el-sozduk.kg/кээ/.",
    "manas-2010:p0966:b001:l004": "Repeated revenge idiom retained; see966:1.",
    "manas-2010:p0966:b001:l013": "Forest made an enemy in13–14 is the unusual printed metaphor, not silently regularized.",
    "manas-2010:p0966:b001:l025": "Printed Он эки кылым, салбады is elliptical. Generic struck retains the negative verb; no missing object or corrected Kyrgyz asserted. Compare975:12.",
    "manas-2010:p0966:b001:l027": "Turning the lasso-pole is retained as the opposition image.",
    "manas-2010:p0966:b001:l042": "Saint is the contextual шай sense; no unsupported individual biography added.",
    "manas-2010:p0967:b001:l008": "Your madness retains the printed pronoun in Koshoy’s objection.",
    "manas-2010:p0967:b001:l011": "Forced march/slaughter at Beijing in11–12 has compressed causative agency; no additional battle event supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0967:b001:l016": "Кембай = convoy/escort under guard, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/кембай/; chains are not specified here.",
    "manas-2010:p0967:b001:l024": "Prophet and Ali at Beijing in24–28 are the epic’s sacred history, not an independently verified historical claim.",
    "manas-2010:p0967:b001:l028": "Coming through the intervening time is provisional for the compressed арадан келген phrase.",
    "manas-2010:p0968:b001:l018": "Gendered cowardice language remains the character’s oath.",
    "manas-2010:p0968:b001:l024": "Ample blue overshoes is provisional for the dress epithet with көбөйтүп.",
    "manas-2010:p0968:b001:l031": "Karabayyr is the horse-breed designation; edition glossary1838 describes mixed thoroughbred stock.",
    "manas-2010:p0968:b001:l033": "Sieve-lunged/copper-legged preserves the horse’s figurative stamina and speed.",
    "manas-2010:p0969:b001:l003": "Бар алтын retained as abundant gold; not silently changed to бир.",
    "manas-2010:p0969:b001:l004": "Silver pieces is provisional; the source does not specify a modern currency or precise unit.",
    "manas-2010:p0969:b001:l005": "Eye in darkness is the counselor’s discernment image.",
    "manas-2010:p0969:b001:l009": "Rich man’s son retains бай as a title/status; a personal name Bay is also possible.",
    "manas-2010:p0969:b001:l034": "Келеме бото is netted outer clothing: edition glossary1839:b001:l004.",
    "manas-2010:p0969:b001:l039": "Келеңкер is jeweled braid/adornment: edition glossary1839:b001:l008–009.",
    "manas-2010:p0970:b001:l013": "The unusual claim that no mortal has entered is retained rather than normalized.",
    "manas-2010:p0970:b001:l018": "Найдар is a spyglass, Karasayev dialect entry https://el-sozduk.kg/най/; бурамалуу supplies the screw-fitted construction.",
    "manas-2010:p0970:b001:l025": "Tasselled drawstring/forty joints is a compressed clothing epithet; attachment to the adjacent named figure remains uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0970:b001:l028": "Кул is rendered servant in Shuutu’s designation; exact legal status not established.",
    "manas-2010:p0970:b001:l032": "Corrected after individual PDF reinspection and primary Yudakhin чок I2: exact чок белбоо means tasselled sash/belt (quotes алтын айдар чок белбоо), not fiery. Existing golden forelock/crest wording preserved.",
    "manas-2010:p0970:b001:l041": "Жекене is a belt, edition glossary1837:b001:l034.",
    "manas-2010:p0971:b001:l004": "Piebald-headed winged steed is the comparison, not a new named horse.",
    "manas-2010:p0971:b001:l009": "Strapping is the contextual means of wrapping the weapon; exact fastening construction unspecified.",
    "manas-2010:p0971:b001:l014": "Prophet’s faith describes Almambet’s adherence, not Almambet as a prophet.",
    "manas-2010:p0971:b001:l018": "Сандыргалуу rendered stately, primary dictionary https://el-sozduk.kg/сандырга/.",
    "manas-2010:p0971:b001:l028": "Мыйзам here is autumn gossamer; Yudakhin quotes this exact куурай/мыйзам formula, https://el-sozduk.kg/myyzam-6/.",
    "manas-2010:p0971:b001:l033": "Cow-tail-bone is a horse-shape comparison, not an actual bovine body part.",
    "manas-2010:p0972:b001:l002": "Калдагай means enormous/ungainly/shapeless, primary Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калдагай/.",
    "manas-2010:p0972:b001:l004": "Чунак is the derogatory rogue epithet in this context.",
    "manas-2010:p0972:b001:l009": "Sixty languages is clear from the surrounding speech description; exact бурку modifier remains provisional.",
    "manas-2010:p0972:b001:l021": "Image reads жөө, on foot; not silently emended to жоо, enemy.",
    "manas-2010:p0972:b001:l024": "Mountain is visibly printed; not silently changed to enemy.",
    "manas-2010:p0972:b001:l035": "Кол interpreted as army in this mobilization context.",
    "manas-2010:p0973:b001:l020": "The implicit subject in20–24 is provisionally Bakay, explicitly named later at39.",
    "manas-2010:p0973:b001:l025": "Civilian blame in25–31 remains the character’s warning.",
    "manas-2010:p0973:b001:l038": "Ethnic/religious contrast retained as the speaker’s warning, without endorsement.",
    "manas-2010:p0974:b001:l008": "Кембай retains the guard/escort sense; no chains supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0974:b001:l012": "Drawing a line is the literal gesture; precise threatened action remains implicit.",
    "manas-2010:p0974:b001:l034": "Twelve thousand retained as the printed troop count.",
    "manas-2010:p0975:b001:l012": "Twelve nations had not attacked is the epic negative-attack formula; compare compressed966:25.",
    "manas-2010:p0975:b001:l014": "Жая is the horse’s hindquarter meat in this context.",
    "manas-2010:p0975:b001:l032": "Seven khans retained beside other references to twelve; no numerical harmonization.",
    "manas-2010:p0975:b001:l039": "Кулан is wild ass; herd-ownership rhetoric not used to emend the animal name.",
    "manas-2010:p0976:b001:l013": "Бадыраң темир is plain/common iron, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/бадыраң/; not brittle iron. The surrounding contrast is figurative.",
    "manas-2010:p0976:b001:l015": "Чалгырт provisionally deception/dissembling in the warning.",
    "manas-2010:p0976:b001:l040": "Огой = ногой, Nogay, positively supported by this edition’s preface15:b002:l005–007 listing dropped-n spellings. Not өгөй, estranged.",
    "manas-2010:p0976:b001:l041": "Pit and brine in41–42 are retained as a conditional self-curse, not an event asserted to occur.",
    "manas-2010:p0977:b001:l011": "Chalyar retained as a personal name: edition glossary1834:b001:l003–013 explicitly says Karalaev treats чалыяр as an individual among the six lions, although its etymology is four friends.",
    "manas-2010:p0977:b001:l013": "His Holiness is the source’s sacred title; Ali is possible from967 but not explicitly named here.",
    "manas-2010:p0977:b001:l017": "Кечил rendered monks; the exact religious/political grouping is unspecified.",
    "manas-2010:p0977:b001:l018": "Калча = fearsome/formidable person, edition glossary1838:b001:l030–031; not an unsupported stocky build.",
    "manas-2010:p0977:b001:l020": "Shot-proof clothing is the epic’s claim about Kanykey’s workmanship.",
    "manas-2010:p0977:b001:l037": "Six horses retained as the literal count.",
    "manas-2010:p0978:b001:l013": "Cloud and star imagery retained without identifying modern constellations.",
    "manas-2010:p0978:b001:l015": "Friend in the afterlife retains the oath’s stated scope.",
    "manas-2010:p0978:b001:l019": "Violent threats in19–29 belong to the character’s speech.",
    "manas-2010:p0978:b001:l029": "Даңгыт is a large dog, edition glossary1836:b001:l028.",
    "manas-2010:p0978:b001:l039": "The return-from-Beijing wording is retained despite the army’s pending departure; temporal incongruity not harmonized.",
    "manas-2010:p0978:b001:l042": "Sentence continues onto979; no invented completion appended.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b003:l004": "Box-shaped beards preserves the үкөк simile.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b003:l005": "Sart retained as a historical group designation, not equated with a modern ethnicity.",
    "manas-2010:p0964:b003:l009": "Dust image accompanies the arrivals; not an actual fire.",
    "manas-2010:p0974:b001:l022": "Corrected after individual PDF reinspection and primary Yudakhin чок I2: exact чок белбоо means tasselled sash/belt (quotes алтын айдар чок белбоо), not fiery. Existing golden forelock/crest wording preserved."
